r is pretty nervous but  nonetheless she proceeds with it Susan  immediately recognizes her estranged  daughter and appears to feel guilty for  leaving her however the very next second  her other daughter arrives indicating  that she has commenced a new life here  this enrages Kara and she starts running  ignoring miles's pleas for her to stop  unfortunately she ends up getting hit  and knocked out by a car miles quickly  arrives at the scene but Kara seems to  be unconscious she is not breathing it  appears as if she has met her untimely  demise but just then a so-called doctor  steps out of a nearby car he is none  other than John Dove the guy miles saved  earlier at the subway John immediately  administers CPR and resuscitates Kara  hence saving her life miles is left in  utter disbelief at how everyone is  connected to one another the next  morning at the hospital Cara appears to  have recovered from the shock in the  meantime her estranged mother Susan  visits her and apologizes for leaving  her 22 years ago she then reveals that  she never came back because of her  abusive husband she did see her daughter  a few times at school but never had the  courage to approach her hearing all this  Kara tears up and eventually forgives  her mother in this way the friend  suggestions from God saved the lives of  two different people Cara and John Dove  Kara's probably still a crappy writer  though a few days passed by and Miles  has started to move on from the bizarre  incidents that brought him closer to  some unknown people he has also resumed  his daily podcast where he still  preaches about atheism one day a big  company approaches him and offers to  take his podcast to the next level they  offer him a six-figure contract which  will see him becoming rich overnight  miles is ecstatic with the offer but the  same day God sends him another friend  suggestion on Facebook this time it's a  woman named Katie Brooks however miles  declines it and goes to meet his new as  th