ng  non-verbal the boys picked up the tune  and it seems is like he has finally  found his passion his father may have  left him at a young age but John Lennon  never did oh I guess Nate doesn't know  about Yoko Ono at last miles finally  realizes that God is indeed real and  stops talking about Atheism in his  podcasts he even cancels his six-figure  contract with the large company with the  days passing by Miles gets several  friend suggestions on Facebook by God  and he helps each of them overcome their  problems however he is curious to know  what God actually looks like one day his  chance finally comes through a book he  gets to know that God is living in the  Himalayas miles immediately travels to  Nepal and climbs through the dangerous  mountains after days of wandering around  a little monk approaches him and says  follow me she's been waiting for you if  this story taught me anything it's that  God spends too much time on social media  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

